  "category": "Meditate Pokémon",
  "entries": [
    {
      "text": "MEDITITE undertakes rigorous mental training deep in the mountains. However, whenever it meditates, this POKéMON always loses its concentration and focus. As a result, its training never ends.",
      "version": "ruby"
    },
    {
      "text": "MEDITITE heightens its inner energy through meditation. It survives on just one berry a day. Minimal eating is another aspect of this POKéMON’s training.",
      "version": "sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "It continually meditates for hours every day. As a result of rigorous and dedicated yoga training, it has tempered its spiritual power so much it can fly.",
      "version": "emerald"
    },
    {
      "text": "It never skips its daily yoga training. It heightens its inner strength through meditation.",
      "version": "firered"
    },
    {
      "text": "It never skips its daily yoga training. It heightens its inner strength through meditation.",
      "version": "leafgreen"
    },
    {
      "text": "It eats just one berry a day. By enduring hunger, its spirit is tempered and made sharper.",
      "version": "diamond"
    },
    {
      "text": "It never misses its daily yoga workouts, and it heightens its spiritual power through meditation.",
      "version": "pearl"
    },
    {
      "text": "It always trains deep in mountains. It levitates when it heightens its spiritual power through meditation.",
      "version": "platinum"
    },
    {
